				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-01T09:53:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おそうじ一筋　５０年！
若いもんには　負けんわい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-04T02:51:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
