		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="INF_BATTLE_START_MSG_TRID_033"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ボクには　みらいが　みえている！▽
……さぁ　たたかおう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-04T03:17:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ボクには　未来が　見えている！▽
……さぁ　戦おう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-04T03:17:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
