				Time="2011-07-05T07:19:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フフッ！　データを　取らせてもらうよ
ポケモンを　出したまえ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-05T07:19:53" />
