	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="INF_BATTLE_START_MSG_TRID_038"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>けいさんに　よれば　ボクが
かつ　かのうせいは１２０パーセント！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-05T07:19:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>計算に　よれば　ボクが
勝つ可能性は１２０パーセント！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-05T07:20:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>けんきゅういん 男 b</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
