	<TextRow
		Label="INF_BATTLE_START_MSG_TRID_141"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>やっと　５ごうめと　いったところだな
まだまだ　さきは　ながいぞ▼
……どれ　これより　したに　すすむ
ちからがあるか　みてやるわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-06T06:52:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>やっと　５合目と　言った所だな
まだまだ　先は　長いぞ▼
……どれ　これより下に
進む力があるか　見てやるわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-06T06:52:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>やまおとこ 男 w</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-01T09:20:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="INF_BATTLE_START_MSG_TRID_142"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>やまのような　ゆうだいな
わたしに　かてるかな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>山のような　雄大な
私に　勝てるかな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
